<testgrp id="RM000003YYX02SX_03_0010" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IK900000">
<testtitle>Inspect Setting Operation</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Delete all music files in the USB memory or "iPod", and format or restore it.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>Formatting the USB memory or restoring the "iPod" erases all music files on the device. Back up the music files before performing this operation.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Save the data again and check whether the problem recurs.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.13in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Malfunction recurs</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Returns to normal</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
